type: Decision
title: "Rollback version store: isomorphic-git (pure-JS) over system git or a custom VCS"
description: Context
tags: [architecture, rollback, version-store, git, isomorphic-git, c7, dependency]
status: proposed
timestamp: "2026-07-24T11:40:55.594Z"
